    LLM: 'Game: 5000 Rummy. Logic: See rules.objective and rules.gameplay.',
    Player: '5000 Rummy is a rummy card game that involves melding, sets, runs. The game originated in North America and has become popular worldwide.',
    objective: 'Be the first player to reach the target score (often 5000) by melding sets and runs and going out; opponents add deadwood to your score.',
    gameplay: 'Deal full hands. Turn: draw one (from stock or multiple from discard pile, per variant), meld sets/runs if desired, discard one. Going out ends the round; others count deadwood against them. Round scores (or penalties) accumulate; first to target wins.',
